Gates fixed first ([archive](docs/benchmarks/archive/06-server-scheduling.log)).
Qwen3.5-4B Q8 CUDA, `--ctx 2048`, 1,317-token job plus 47-token interactive
requests, medians of 3. Up to 3 threads; GPU passes go through a gate one at a
time, prompts in 64-token slices, decode and short prompts first (10 ms hold,
2 s aging); sliced prefill is bit-identical to one pass.

| Metric | Sequential | Wait 120 s | Scheduled |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
